OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start to a dry morning
OL,6,Fwith long sunny spells. High cloud
OL,7,Fincreasing in the afternoon, then some
OL,8,Frain edging into Perthshire and
OL,9,FStirlingshire towards evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRain extending east to all
OL,12,Fareas this evening, initially light
OL,13,Fbut some heavier outbreaks developing
OL,14,Flater this evening and overnight. The
OL,15,Frain easing towards morning.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FBright or sunny intervals and
OL,18,Fa few showers, these showers more
OL,19,Ffrequent over western Perthshire and
OL,20,Fthe Trossachs, with the best of the
OL,21,Fsunshine towards Angus.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
