OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSunny
OL,6,Fintervals and some heavy showers on
OL,7,FSaturday, breezy. Mainly dry and
OL,8,Fbright Sunday, winds easing. Monday
OL,9,Fclouding over with some patchy rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
